One panel of Wolly.Dashboard, a fragment of its own: the page puts it
in, and an application may send it alone.  figure is the SVG of
Wolly.Svg, escaped there; empty when there is no sample yet.  With a url
(livePanelFragment) htmx asks for url every every seconds and puts the
answer, the same section, in its place.
-#}
<section class="wolly-panel wolly-{{ kind }}" id="panel-{{ name }}"{% if url %} hx-get="{{ url }}" hx-trigger="every {{ every }}s" hx-swap="outerHTML"{% endif %}>
<h2>{{ title }}</h2>
{% if figure %}{{ figure|safe }}{% else %}<p class="wolly-note">no sample yet</p>{% endif %}
</section>
